      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/godai/{size}/1920_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-04-07T17:55:16.992Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This game could truly be subtitled “Justify It! The Game”, and that’s not a bad thing, as long as everyone is on the same page.<br>\nFor example, no social powers, and you need to convince the mayor to let you into the archives to track down a magical book? You notice an Imp, similar to the ones you’ve fought before, spying outside the window. With Strength+Ranged Combat+Status, you fling the mayor’s nameplate out the window to strike the Imp, showing the mayor just how urgent the situation is.<br>\nIf you have a really big hammer, every overcome check becomes a nail.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-04-07T17:55:16.992Z",
